<title>BELGIUM: Belgium offers OLO 10 and 26 at Feb 24 auction.</title>
<headline>Belgium offers OLO 10 and 26 at Feb 24 auction.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said on Monday it would auction the following linear government bonds (OLOs) on Tuesday February 24:</p>
<p>- 8.75 pct, June 25, 2002, OLO 10, ISIN code BE0000259656;</p>
<p>- 6.25 pct, March 28, 2007, OLO 26, ISIN code BE0000286923.</p>
<p>Payment is due on February 27.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
